title: Fruity
---
Fruity: STAY AWAY FROM MY APPLES! #line:0ab1268 
-> Don't worry I won't take them! #line:07b8954 
    Fruity: Really? Then what are you doing here? #line:075694e 
    -> I'm here to invite you to a party with all the other monsters #line:0035a3f 
    Fruity: The other monsters? No way. #line:0d7cc7c 
    -> What happened? #line:062469f 
    Fruity: They stole my fruit! #line:0b3248a 
    -> That's awful. How about I grow you some new fruit trees? #line:091396b 
    Fruity: Would you do that for me? That would be amazing #line:0fe9385 
    -> Yes! But only if you'll come to the party. #line:0a32b96 
    Fruity: Fine, I'll go to the party if you grow me new fruit trees. #line:0638951 
    <<start_quest "Tree quest">>
-> Sorry, I'll come back later #line:04ad4ee 
===

